# 局内游戏状态（dm_hud）：身上 / 箱内金币按测试开关设好后读得出来，物品链有物品且 id 不重复，服务端有活着的怪（营地 NPC）；
# 保存并退出再进局后金币原样、物品件数不变、id 仍不重复——存档与读回不丢不复制物品
# In-run game state (dm_hud): gold on the character / in the stash reads back as the test switches set it, the item chain holds items with no repeated id, the server has live monsters (camp NPCs);
# after Save and Exit and rejoining, the gold is unchanged, the item count is the same and ids are still unique -- saving and loading neither loses nor copies items
name game_state
save warlock
env DM_TEST_GOLD=1234 DM_TEST_STAT=15=5000
timeout 240

enter_game
expect_state gold=1234 gold_stash=5000 items>=1 item_dups=0 monsters>=1 timeout=10
remember items
open_pause
press A
expect game_leave timeout=30
expect main_menu timeout=60
sleep 1
enter_game
expect_state in_game=true gold=1234 gold_stash=5000 items=$items item_dups=0 timeout=10
quit
check no_red
check saves_valid
